# Typography

Never invent a third font. Load both only via `next/font/google` in `app/layout.tsx`.

| Role | Font | Tailwind | Weight |
|---|---|---|---|
| Headings, display numbers, buttons, nav, kickers | **Montserrat** | `font-heading` | 600–800 |
| Paragraphs, lists, labels, inputs, helper text | **Roboto** | `font-sans` (default) | 400–500 |

## Rules

- `h1`–`h6` inherit Montserrat from `globals.css`. Do not add `font-serif` or a Google `<link>`.
- Body copy uses Roboto. Do not put `font-heading` on `<p>` unless it is a **display numeral** (stat value).
- Page titles use `text-h1` / `text-h2` / `text-h3` when possible. Keep `text-balance` on long titles.
- Kickers (uppercase eyebrows) stay Montserrat: `font-heading text-xs font-semibold uppercase tracking-[0.18em]`.
- Never use Fraunces, Newsreader, Plus Jakarta, Inter, or Georgia for new UI.

```tsx
// ❌ BAD
<h1 className="font-serif text-3xl">Dashboard</h1>
<p className="font-heading">Your next antenatal visit is Tuesday.</p>

// ✅ GOOD
<h1 className="font-heading text-h2 text-navy text-balance">Dashboard</h1>
<p className="text-base leading-relaxed text-ink-muted">Your next antenatal visit is Tuesday.</p>
<p className="font-heading text-3xl font-bold text-navy">32 weeks</p>
```
